{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 03 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">状态空间与 Mamba：长程传播、扫描偏置和 3D 代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">State Space &amp; Mamba</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_018_u_mamba-title\">U-Mamba</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在 nnU-Net 风格 residual CNN encoder/bottleneck 中插入 selective SSM，同时保留 CNN long skips。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Embeds flattened 1D selective Mamba blocks inside an nnU-Net-style residual CNN encoder/bottleneck while retaining CNN decoder and long skips.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">2D/3D 医学影像与 nnU-Net 数据配置</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D or 3D medical image within the automated nnU-Net pipeline</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">逐像素/体素分割</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Dense pixel- or voxel-level segmentation map</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.04722\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_018_u_mamba')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_018_u_mamba')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"U-Mamba original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/3af2449c82da9f586843.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_018_u_mamba\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_018_u_mamba')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_018_u_mamba\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">nnU-Net Planner</span><span class=\"lang-en\">nnU-Net Planner</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">按数据 fingerprint 决定 2D/3D、patch、kernel、spacing 与通道。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d or 3d medical image within the automated nnu-net pipeline and prepares initial tensor representations (nnU-Net Planner).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"按数据 fingerprint 决定 2D/3D、patch、kernel、spacing 与通道。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d or 3d medical image within the automated nnu-net pipeline and prepares initial tensor representations (nnU-Net Planner).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"nnU-Net Planner\" data-node-name-en=\"nnU-Net Planner\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>nnU-Net Planner</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按数据 fingerprint 决定 2D/3D、patch、kernel、spacing 与通道。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d or 3d medical image within the automated nnu-net pipeline and prepares initial tensor representations (nnU-Net Planner).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预处理后的 2D 图像或 3D patch。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"医学影像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">医学影像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预处理后的 2D 图像或 3D patch。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"高分辨率路径先编码局部边缘与空间细节。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Residual CNN within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Residual CNN\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual CNN\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Residual CNN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">高分辨率路径先编码局部边缘与空间细节。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Residual CNN within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在 bottleneck 或各 encoder stage 将空间特征展平为序列。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Spatial→Sequence within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Spatial→Sequence\" data-node-name-en=\"Spatial→Sequence\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Spatial→Sequence</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在 bottleneck 或各 encoder stage 将空间特征展平为序列。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Spatial→Sequence within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"selective scan 沿序列传播远程依赖；Bot/Enc 变体决定放置范围。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mamba Layer within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Mamba Layer\" data-node-name-en=\"Mamba Layer\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Mamba Layer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">selective scan 沿序列传播远程依赖；Bot/Enc 变体决定放置范围。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mamba Layer within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把状态输出恢复到原特征网格。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Sequence→Spatial within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Sequence→Spatial\" data-node-name-en=\"Sequence→Spatial\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Sequence→Spatial</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把状态输出恢复到原特征网格。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Sequence→Spatial within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"未被序列瓶颈替代的高分辨率 CNN 特征直达 decoder。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CNN Long Skips within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"CNN Long Skips\" data-node-name-en=\"CNN Long Skips\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CNN Long Skips</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">未被序列瓶颈替代的高分辨率 CNN 特征直达 decoder。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CNN Long Skips within the core self configuring cnn ssm unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐级上采样并融合局部 skip 与全局 Mamba 表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies CNN Decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"CNN Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"CNN Decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CNN Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐级上采样并融合局部 skip 与全局 Mamba 表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies CNN Decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出医学分割 logits。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces dense pixel- or voxel-level segmentation map via Seg Head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"Seg Head\" data-node-name-en=\"Seg Head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_018_u_mamba', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Seg Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出医学分割 logits。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces dense pixel- or voxel-level segmentation map via Seg Head.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"U-Mamba Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · CNN 局部特征展平后进入 U-Mamba 长程模块</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Hybrid Residual 3D Convolution Coupled with Flattened Selective SSM</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"U-Mamba：核心公式 · CNN 局部特征展平后进入 U-Mamba 长程模块\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"18\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.166374pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.791958 -69.000129 186.540266 11.166374\" width=\"186.540266pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.128975-1.022318L3.990019-1.101722C3.910615-1.002467 3.860988-.95284 3.77166-.833735C3.543375-.535973 3.434195-.436718 3.305165-.436718C3.166209-.436718 3.0768