37\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g7-185\" y=\"-60.002514\"></use><use x=\"64.865095\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g20-67\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"71.510174\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g20-78\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"78.703202\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g20-78\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"85.86714\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g10-18\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"90.714299\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g7-185\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"94.43036\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g13-71\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"99.123562\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g10-18\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"103.472587\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g7-186\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"107.288263\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g7-186\" y=\"-60.002514\"></use><use x=\"111.103901\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g7-186\" y=\"-60.002514\"></use><use x=\"114.919563\" xlink:href=\"#m018_g7-186\" y=\"-60.002514\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">3D CNN 全局依赖弱，而全局注意力成本高</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pure 3D CNNs have local receptive fields, whereas 3D self-attention incurs prohibitive quadratic memory on large patches.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在 nnU-Net 风格 CNN 中加入 Mamba 作为 bottleneck 或 encoder 全局建模器</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Augment residual CNN blocks with flattened Mamba layers inside the self-configuring nnU-Net framework to combine local priors with long-range mixing.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">自配置 U-Net pipeline 加 CNN-SSM hybrid block</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Plug-and-play U-Mamba_Bot and U-Mamba_Enc hybrid architectures preserving nnU-Net preprocessing and long skip connections.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">覆盖多类 2D/3D 医学分割任务</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Evaluated across multi-organ CT, MRI, and endoscopy segmentation benchmarks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">高热度研究基线；后续统一配方消融未发现稳定的 Mamba 独立增益</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">High-visibility hybrid baseline, though subsequent controlled ablations show matched MedNeXt / nnU-Net ResEnc often perform comparably.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">CNN 保留高分辨局部归纳偏置，Mamba 只承担成本敏感的长程混合。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">Bot 与 Enc 变体通过改变 Mamba 放置位置检验全局建模范围。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">沿用 nnU-Net self-configuration，使结构变化与数据适配 recipe 绑定。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Augment residual CNN blocks with flattened Mamba layers inside the self-configuring nnU-Net framework to combine local priors with long-range mixing.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Plug-and-play U-Mamba_Bot and U-Mamba_Enc hybrid architectures preserving nnU-Net preprocessing and long skip connections.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Hybrid Residual 3D Convolution Coupled with Flattened Selective SSM.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合研究 3D attention 太贵而 CNN 全局关系有限的折中方案。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">必须与 no-Mamba 同构 residual U-Net 比较，才能归因 selective scan 的独立贡献。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Evaluated across multi-organ CT, MRI, and endoscopy segmentation benchmarks.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: High-visibility hybrid baseline, though subsequent controlled ablations show matched MedNeXt / nnU-Net ResEnc often perform comparably.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.04722\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>U-Mamba: Enhancing Long-range Dependency for Biomedical Image Segmentation</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/bowang-lab/U-Mamba\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}